{"text":"How's MIS major at NSU? One of my faculty members with whom I have good connections, suggested me to take MIS as a major as I am willing to complete my postgrad in Canada. Hence there are some questions that crosses my mind:\n1. As a MIS major, what'll be useful stuff that we may learn and can be carried forward to my MBA degree abroad? \n2. Is NSU well equipped to conduct a quality experience for MIS majors? … See more","image_alt":[]}